Command:
  bun test packages/omo-senpi/src/components/task/event-bridge-session-lifecycle.test.ts \
    -t 'persisted before restart'

Result:
  RED (exit 1).

Expected:
  session_start re-observes `task-terminal` for team-member liveness even when lifecycle reconciliation
  has no outcome for a task whose terminal transition was already persisted by the prior process.

Received:
  no liveness observation.

Root cause:
  event-bridge only re-observed task IDs returned in `reconcileOnSessionStart().outcomes`.
  Reconciliation skips already-terminal same-session records, so a member that became terminal before
  the old lead died had no outcome in the restarted lead and could never produce the liveness wake.

This matches the real Team E2E artifact:
  crash recovery, reservation reclaim, replacement delivery, and restart exit all passed, while the
  structured liveness message was absent from the restarted lead transcript.
